# Supervisor pointer

If this chat is **supervisor, triage, oversight, routing, “what’s next”,
or a done-check** — follow
[`docs/prompts/supervisor.md`](docs/prompts/supervisor.md) for the whole
session (`docs/prompts/triage.md` is an alias). Do not implement a
leftover in that chat.

Implementation chats still follow the slice prompt named in `roadmap.md`
**Now** (one slice per chat). Do not invent a second plan.
